<title>USA: Vastar names Charles Davidson president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Vastar names Charles Davidson president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vastar Resources Inc said Thursday it had elected Charles Davidson as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Davidson, 47, succeeds Michael Wiley, who will be joining Atlantic Richfield Co, Vastar's majority shareholder. Wiley will continue as chairman of Vastar's board.</p>
<p>Davidson has been a senior vice president of Vastar responsible for production since September 1993 and has been a member of the board since March 1994.</p>
</text>
